  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2019-03-17T22:58:46Z\"\u003e18 March 2019\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Changes at Parliament this week\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \n  \n  \n              \n\n\n\n      \n\n\n      \n  \n\n    \n        Hon Chris Hipkins\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Leader of the House\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMembers of Parliament will gather in the House at 2pm on Tuesday 19 March, and after statements of condolence led by the Prime Minister the House will adjourn for the day.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe House will next meet on Wednesday at 2pm for Members Day, as scheduled.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Members of Parliament will gather in the House at 2pm on Tuesday 19 March, and after statements of condolence led by the Prime Minister the House will adjourn for the day. The House will next meet on Wednesday at 2pm for Members Day, as scheduled.",
